# The compilers image is FROM scratch + COPY nexus/compilers-dist /compilers — so its build context
# needs ONLY that dir. Exclude everything else (this file takes precedence over .dockerignore for
# `-f ci/Dockerfile.compilers` builds), keeping the context to the ~600M lean toolchain slice.
*
!nexus/compilers-dist
!nexus/compilers-dist/**
